  "(03) The Name": "（03）名字",
  "\"Is there any?\"": "「有沒有？」",
  "\"Apple\", in Japanese": "日文的「蘋果」",
  "A name that asks a question": "一個本身就是問句的名字",
  "Somebody out there is looking for apples. Most people just call me <em>Ringo</em>.": "總有人在找蘋果。大多數人直接叫我 <em>Ringo</em>。",

  "Chapter": "章節",
  "2017 — 2024 / Minecraft": "2017 — 2024 / Minecraft",
  "Built a national railway": "為一個不存在的國家，",
  "for a country that": "蓋了一整條",
  "doesn't exist.": "國營鐵路。",
  "On the Ringo MRT Server, a group of friends and I founded the Republic of Ringo, and inside it, the National Ringo Railway Corporation. I built stations, and wired them with redstone and command blocks until minecarts dispatched, stopped and opened platform screen doors on their own.": "在蘋果地鐵伺服器（Ringo MRT Server）上，我和一群網友成立了虛擬國度「Republic of Ringo」，並在其中創立國立蘋果鐵路股份有限公司（NRRC）。我負責蓋車站，再用紅石和指令方塊把它們串起來，直到礦車能自己發車、停靠、開啟月台門。",
  "Architecture": "建築",
  "Command blocks": "指令方塊",
  "Seven years": "七年",
  "Junior high / Scratch": "國中 / Scratch",
  "Rebuilt Papers, Please": "在 Scratch 裡",
  "in Scratch.": "重做了 Papers, Please。",
  "My school sent me to a city-wide competition. I brought a border-checkpoint game inspired by Papers, Please, and came home with a Merit Award from New Taipei City.": "學校推派我參加全市競賽。我帶著一款致敬 Papers, Please 的邊境檢查遊戲出賽，拿下新北市優等。",
  "Game design": "遊戲設計",
  "Merit Award": "優等",
  "2018 — now / TWERG": "2018 — 現在 / TWERG",
  "\"Can I add you": "「可以加你",
  "on Discord?\"": "Discord 嗎？」",
  "One question in an earthquake livestream chat turned into the Taiwan Earthquake Recording Group. Eight years later it is a community of 10,000 people. I built its website, its heavy rain warning map and its DYFI intensity algorithm: JavaScript and CSS on the front, Python to train and check the math, Cloudflare to keep it online.": "在地震直播聊天室裡問的一句話，成立了地牛記錄小組。八年後成長為了一萬人的社群，網站、豪雨特報地圖、DYFI 體感震度演算法都由我打造：前端用 JavaScript 與 CSS，用 Python 訓練與驗證算法，部署在 Cloudflare 上。",
  "Founder": "創辦人",
  "10,000 members": "一萬名成員",
  "VRChat / Xiaomi 14 Ultra": "VRChat / Xiaomi 14 Ultra",
  "Learned to see": "在不存在的世界裡，",
  "in worlds that": "學會了",
  "don't exist.": "怎麼看。",
  "I could not take a photo until I started shooting inside VRChat. Frame after virtual frame taught me photography by subtraction: take things away until only the point remains. Now I reach for long lenses to find what the naked eye walks past.": "我原本不會拍照，直到開始在 VRChat 裡拍。一張又一張虛擬畫面，教會我「刪去法」：把多餘的拿掉，直到只剩重點。現在我偏愛長焦，去找肉眼會錯過的東西。",
  "Composition by subtraction": "刪去法構圖",
  "Enter Focal Length": "進入「焦段」",
  "In development / Unity": "開發中 / Unity",
  "Two siblings.": "一對兄妹。",
  "A debt they never made.": "一筆不屬於他們的債。",
  "One hundred days.": "一百天。",
  "A dark galgame where every number and every line of text is tuned by hand. Planning, programming, writing and systems design are mine. Art, music and sound come from collaborators.": "一款黑暗的 galgame，每一個數值、每一行文字都經過手工調校。企劃、程式、劇本與系統設計由我負責；美術、音樂與音效來自合作夥伴。",
  "Narrative design": "敘事設計",
