  "(06) Off the Record": "（06）私下的我",
  "The quieter": "比較隱蔽的",
  "half of me.": "另一半。",
  "Pink is my favorite color. Kuromi is my favorite character. Both are non-negotiable.": "最喜歡的顏色是粉紅色，最喜歡的角色是庫洛米。這兩件事沒得商量。",
  "\"Sensitive, and careful with details.\" A school counselor said it first. The numbers in my galgame agree.": "「感性，而且心思細膩。」這是諮商心理師先說的。我 galgame 裡的數值也同意該觀點。",
  "A plush doll beside a rose in a silver vase": "銀色花瓶裡的玫瑰旁，坐著一隻布偶",
  "I collect life-size dolls, shop for their outfits, then photograph them. This one is on 75mm.": "我收藏等身娃娃，幫她們挑衣服，再替她們拍照。這張用的是 75mm。",
  "Anime, yuri, and other people's original characters. I love seeing what people invent.": "動畫、百合，還有別人的原創角色。我很喜歡看大家創造出來的東西。",
  "Restless curiosity. I would rather try ten new things than repeat one. That is how a Minecraft kid ended up here.": "停不下來的好奇心。比起重複一件事，我寧願嘗試十件新的。一個玩 Minecraft 的孩子，就是這樣走到這裡的。",

