  "First warning is out. Only the point source is known.": "第一報已發布，目前只知道點源。",
  "Station data arriving. The direction is being estimated.": "測站資料陸續到達，正在估計破裂方向。",
  "Direction locked at {deg}°. Intensity ahead of the rupture is raised.": "方向鎖定在 {deg}°，破裂前方的震度已調高。",
  "First warning estimate: M{mag}, {depth} km deep": "第一報估計：規模 {mag}，深度 {depth} 公里",
  "Retrospective, {n} key cities. Strong-shaking misses {a} to {b}. Mean error {c} to {d} intensity levels.": "回溯模擬，{n} 個關鍵城市。高震度漏報從 {a} 變成 {b}；平均誤差從 {c} 變成 {d} 級。",
  "What the replay taught me": "模擬教會我的事",
  "Direction fixes <em>where</em> the shaking goes, not <em>how big</em> the earthquake is.": "方向修正的是搖晃<em>往哪裡去</em>，不是地震<em>有多大</em>。",
  "In Hualien the first magnitude was close, and correcting direction turned three missed strong-shaking cities into none. In Chishang and Nanxi the first magnitude was off, and correcting direction alone could not close the gap. For Nanxi it even pushed an already high estimate higher. That is the next problem to solve.": "花蓮的第一報規模很接近，修正方向後，三個漏報的高震度城市全部補了回來。池上和楠西的第一報規模本身就估錯了，只修正方向補不回這個差距；楠西甚至把原本就偏高的估計推得更高。這就是下一個要解決的問題。",
